<title>SWITZERLAND: Novartis to buy rest of Systemix.</title>
<headline>Novartis to buy rest of Systemix.</headline>
<dateline>BASLE, Switzerland 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss pharmaceuticals group Novartis AG said it reached definitive agreement to acquire all the issued and outstanding shares of SyStemix common stock which it does not already own for $19.50 in cash.</p>
<p>Novartis said it currently owns 10.6 million SyStemix common shares which on October 31, 1996 represented 73.2 percent of the issued and outstanding shares.</p>
</text>
